hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16722","He said: Abu al-Nadr narrated to us, he said: al-Masudi narrated to us, from Muhajir Abu al-Hasan, from an old man who reached the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said: I went out with the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) on a journey, and he passed by a man reciting: Say: O disbelievers; he said: As for this one, he is quit of shirk; he said: And there was another reciting: Say: He is Allah, One; the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: By it Paradise became due for him."
